Protein name: Human deoxyhaemoglobin
Organism: homo sapiens
PDB ID: 4HHB
Experimental method (X-ray, Cryo-EM, NMR, etc.): X-ray diffraction
Resolution (if available): 1.74 Å
Biological significance: assists in caron dioxide clearance, and efficient oxygen delivery by adopting a tense form which unload oxygen to oxygen-starved tissues

